{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41673","headline":"贺容府韦中丞大府贤兄新除黔南经略 · 陈陶","name":"贺容府韦中丞大府贤兄新除黔南经略","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓬瀛簪笏旧联行，紫极差池降宠章。\n列国山河分鴈字，一门金玉尽龙骧。\n耿家符节朝中美，袁氏芝兰阃外香。\n烽戍悠悠限巴越，伫听歌咏两甘棠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41673.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41673","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}